The '''Argofay Branchstrutter''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Wyld Woods}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Argofay Branchstrutters''' walk around the trees in the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} aimlessly and serve no apparent purpose.

== Trivia ==
*"Argofay" is likely [[w:Pig Latin|Pig Latin]] for "Fargo".

